                        middle of chapter 69) <handNotes>
                            <handNote xml:id="copistaS" />
                        </handNotes></witness>
                    <witness xml:id="T">Sinai ar. 456 (13th century), fols 18v-60v (lacks the
                        introduction and is truncated at the very end of chapter 71)<handNotes>
                            <handNote xml:id="copistaT" />
                        </handNotes></witness>
                    <witness xml:id="B">Tripoli, Dayr Sayyidat al-Balamand (17th century?)<handNotes>
